      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Women are the main source of why I create.  Women are just born with this
    instinctive strength that keeps me motivated.  Also, any creative human working
    toward a purpose or meaningful goal.  I put energy into every piece I make to
    give them strength and confidence so that we creatives can feel that we are not
    alone, and that we can create our world together.\u201D   When asked what inspires
    her, she offers \u201CNASA, artificial intelligence, and engineers in general.\u201D     
    \n\r\nJeniece Blanchet, designer\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
